sat-title = Any device can be a satellite.
sat-lede = A satellite pairs with a code, declares what it can do, streams audio over WebRTC and carries out what the core asks.
sat-pair-title = Pairing takes a code.
sat-pair-text = The person pairing it picks the method: a code the device shows or says aloud, an enrollment code typed on it, a QR code, or one given in its configuration. It gets its own token and only the capabilities you allowed. Refused by default, revocable at any time.
